OL,3,GNEWSADerelict market gets #1m heritage
OL,4,Afunding boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19th-century market hall in
OL,7,FStoke-on-Trent is among 74 heritage
OL,8,Fsites in England due to receive a share
OL,9,Fof #41m for repairs and renovations.
OL,11,FThe Grade II listed Burslem indoor
OL,12,Fmarket, on Queen Street, was built in
OL,13,F1879, but it shut in 2003 after masonry
OL,14,Fdropped from the ceiling and it became
OL,15,Funsafe, the council said.
OL,17,FThe market is set to receive #1m as
OL,18,Fpart of the funding allocation, which
OL,19,Fcomes after a #4m scheme got under way
OL,20,Fin April.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
